# Project 3, U-Boot: THE MARKER ONLY.
#
# This is what the BASELINE is built with. It adds the first electrical
# marker to Project 2's configuration and changes nothing else, so that
# the baseline measures Project 2's boot rather than an already improved
# one.
#
# The trimming lives in fast.config, which is the 10-uboot variant. Two
# files rather than one file with lines commented in and out: that dance
# was the original design, it is invisible in a diff, and the instruction
# describing it was wrong within a day of being written. One change, one
# fragment, one result directory, as everywhere else in this project.

# The preboot command runs before the boot delay and before any storage
# scanned, which is what makes D1 the start of the measured interval
# rather than a point somewhere inside U-Boot.
CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT=y
CONFIG_PREBOOT="gpio set PG11"

# Without this, "gpio" is not a command U-Boot has, CONFIG_PREBOOT names
# something that does not exist, and the failure is silent as far as the
# trace is concerned: the board boots normally and D1 stays low.
CONFIG_CMD_GPIO=y
